# Team fixture — asserted graph layer for TestTeamGraph / TestTeamPageEmbedsGraph.
# Member nodes zone-auth / domain-core / coord-voice / orchestrator are registered by derive from the
# typed dirs; this file carries the asserted bond chain + the shared skill the derived
# layer cannot register (host-skill tdd is CLAUDE-only; the graph must still name a shared skill).
# Policy-trumps over the coord sketch (2026-10-04-team-graph-fixture-verdict.md): orchestrator has
# NO ao:name line here (derive registers its own), prefix is the workspace's <agent-one:>, and the
# chain rides truth/verdict/reports — never after.
@prefix ao: <agent-one:> .

ao:zone-auth ao:truth   ao:domain-core .
ao:domain-core   ao:verdict ao:coord-voice .
ao:coord-voice  ao:reports ao:orchestrator    .

ao:zone-auth ao:holds ao:skill-tdd .
ao:skill-tdd a ao:skill ; ao:shared "true" .

